===Noun===
{{en-noun|vermiform appendices|+}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} An organ consisting of a blind tube projecting from the [[caecum]]. Of disputed function (if any), it is known for inflammation in humans.
#: {{syn|en|appendix|vermiformis}}

